@startuml
!theme black-knight

autonumber
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 150

participant "Simulation Engine" as Engine
participant "Current Tile" as MasterTile
participant "Neighboring Tiles" as Neighbors
participant "Object Data" as Memory

Engine -> MasterTile : Begin processing area
MasterTile -> Memory : Load objects located in this tile

note over MasterTile
  Phase 1: Local Interactions
end note
MasterTile -> MasterTile : Calculate interactions between\nobjects within the same tile

note over MasterTile, Neighbors
  Phase 2: Neighborhood Interactions
end note
MasterTile -> Neighbors : Request objects from surrounding 8 tiles
Neighbors --> MasterTile : Return neighboring objects
MasterTile -> MasterTile : Calculate interactions between\nlocal objects and neighbor objects

note over MasterTile, Memory
  Phase 3: State Update
end note
MasterTile -> Memory : Save new positions and velocities
@enduml
